INSERT INTO `mx_pump_category` VALUES (1,0,'Pump',NULL,'<p>Bombay Engineering Syndicate supplies the complete Crompton pump range from our Fort, Mumbai showroom and Satellite, Ahmedabad office — submersible borewell pumps, openwell pumps, monoblock and mini pumps, pressure boosters, and agricultural pumps. Every pump is genuine, factory-warranted, and backed by 67 years of selection expertise. Browse categories below or <a href=\"/pump-inquiry/\">send an inquiry</a> for free sizing guidance.</p>',NULL,0,'pump','en',NULL,0,1),(2,1,'Agricultural Pump',NULL,'<p>Agricultural pumps built for Indian farm conditions — irrigation, borewell extraction, and water transfer for crops from paddy to horticulture. Our range covers centrifugal monoset pumps for canal and pond lifting plus heavy-duty agricultural submersibles, all MNRE-listed models eligible for PM-KUSUM solar subsidies. BES engineers help size pumps to your borewell yield, acreage, and crop water demand.</p>',NULL,0,'pump/agricultural-pump','en',NULL,0,1),(4,2,'Centrifugal Monoset',NULL,'<p>Centrifugal monoset pumps combine motor and pump in one compact, close-coupled unit — ideal for farm water transfer, canal lifting, sprinkler feeds, and general irrigation duty. Available in single-phase and three-phase versions with cast-iron construction, these Crompton monosets deliver dependable performance with minimal maintenance. Rated from 0.5 HP to 25 HP.</p>',NULL,0,'pump/agricultural-pump/centrifugal-monoset','en',NULL,0,1),(17,5,'Testing 3 level one',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'pump/agricultural-pump/testing-3-level-one','en',NULL,0,0),(18,5,'Testing 3rd level Two',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'pump/agricultural-pump/testing-3rd-level-two','en',NULL,0,0),(19,5,'Pumps third level Category',NULL,'Testing',NULL,0,'pump/agricultural-pump/pumps-third-level-category','en',NULL,0,0),(22,0,'home pump',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'home-pump','en',NULL,0,0),(23,1,'Residential Pumps',NULL,'<p>Residential pumps for every home water need — from borewell submersibles that lift water from 300 feet to booster pumps that fix weak shower pressure. This range covers Mumbai flats, Ahmedabad bungalows, housing societies, and farmhouses alike. All Crompton models with ISI certification, energy-efficient motors, and pan-India service support through the authorised network.</p>',NULL,0,'pump/residential-pumps',NULL,NULL,0,1),(24,23,'Mini Pumps',NULL,'<p>Mini pumps are compact self-priming monoblock pumps for everyday domestic water transfer — filling overhead tanks from sumps, boosting tap flow, and general household duty. Popular Crompton models like Mini Master, Mini Crest, Champ, Star, and Aquagold serve lakhs of Indian homes. Quiet operation, 0.5-1.5 HP ratings, and brass impellers for long life in city water conditions.</p>',NULL,0,'pump/residential-pumps/mini-pumps',NULL,NULL,0,1),(25,23,'DMB-CMB Pumps',NULL,'<p>DMB and CMB series domestic monoblock pumps are Crompton\'s workhorse home pumps — reliable tank-filling and water transfer for independent homes and small buildings. Simple installation, ISI-marked, with wide voltage tolerance for Indian power conditions. The DMB self-priming design handles suction lift up to 7 metres without a foot valve headache.</p>',NULL,0,'pump/residential-pumps/dmb-cmb-pumps',NULL,NULL,0,1),(26,23,'Shallow Well Pumps',NULL,'<p>Shallow well jet pumps (SWJ series) extract water from sources up to 8 metres deep — perfect for shallow tube wells, sumps, and surface water where a submersible is unnecessary. The jet-assisted suction design maintains strong flow even at maximum depth. Surface-mounted for easy maintenance, available in 0.5-1 HP single-phase ratings for homes and small farms.</p>',NULL,0,'pump/residential-pumps/shallow-well-pumps',NULL,NULL,0,1),(27,23,'3-Inch Borewell',NULL,'<p>3-inch borewell submersible pumps fit compact 76 mm borewells common in urban plots and older drillings. Despite the slim profile, these Crompton pumps deliver water from up to 150 feet with oil-filled or water-filled motor options. ISI-certified and MNRE-listed, they are the standard choice for Mumbai and Ahmedabad homes with space-constrained borewells.</p>',NULL,0,'pump/residential-pumps/3-inch-borewell',NULL,NULL,0,1),(28,23,'4-Inch Borewell',NULL,'<p>4-inch borewell submersible pumps are India\'s most common deep-well pumps — fitting standard 100 mm borewell casings and lifting water from up to 300+ feet. Our Crompton range spans 0.5 HP to 7.5 HP in single and three-phase, with stainless steel and noryl impeller options. Every pump ships with genuine warranty; matched control panels and cable available.</p>',NULL,0,'pump/residential-pumps/4-inch-borewell',NULL,NULL,0,1),(29,23,'Openwell Pumps',NULL,'<p>Openwell submersible pumps work fully submerged in open dug wells, tanks, and sumps — no priming, no suction problems, minimal noise. Horizontal and vertical configurations suit different well depths and installation styles. Widely used across Maharashtra and Gujarat farms and older properties with traditional wells. Ratings from 0.5 HP to 5 HP.</p>',NULL,0,'pump/residential-pumps/openwell-pumps',NULL,NULL,0,1),(30,23,'Booster Pumps',NULL,'<p>Pressure booster pumps solve the most common urban water complaint — weak flow in showers, taps, and appliances. From compact single-bathroom boosters to society-scale pressure systems, our Crompton range maintains constant pressure automatically. Essential for Mumbai high-rises, Ahmedabad bungalows with terrace tanks, and any home where gravity alone is not enough.</p>',NULL,0,'pump/residential-pumps/booster-pumps',NULL,NULL,0,1),(31,23,'Control Panels',NULL,'<p>Pump control panels protect your investment — dry-run protection stops the pump when the borewell runs low, voltage guards handle Indian grid fluctuations, and auto-start switches manage tank levels without manual intervention. Matched panels for single-phase and three-phase submersibles, factory-wired and ready to install alongside any Crompton pump we supply.</p>',NULL,0,'pump/residential-pumps/control-panels',NULL,NULL,0,1),(32,2,'Agricultural Pumps',NULL,'<p>Heavy-duty agricultural pumps for serious irrigation — high-discharge monoblocks and submersibles engineered for continuous field duty. These Crompton models handle long pumping hours through Indian summers with robust windings and generous service factors. MNRE-listed models qualify for solar conversion under PM-KUSUM with 60-90% subsidy for eligible farmers.</p>',NULL,0,'pump/agricultural-pump/agricultural-pumps','en',NULL,0,1),(33,23,'Solar Pumps',NULL,'<p>Crompton solar submersible pumps run on solar power — eliminating diesel and grid dependence for farms and remote sites across Maharashtra and Gujarat. Available in 2 HP to 10 HP, AC and DC, for heads from 30 to 100 metres. MNRE-listed models qualify for 60-90% PM-KUSUM subsidy. Bombay Engineering Syndicate helps with sizing, subsidy paperwork, and Gujarat-wide supply.</p>',NULL,0,'pump/residential-pumps/solar-pumps',NULL,NULL,0,1),(34,23,'Sewage & Drainage Pumps',NULL,'<p>Sewage and drainage pumps handle waste water, effluent, and flood water — for buildings, societies, basements, and industrial drainage. Crompton STP-series submersible sewage pumps move solids-laden water reliably where ordinary pumps clog. Bombay Engineering Syndicate supplies the range with expert selection for your drainage or effluent application.</p>',NULL,0,'pump/residential-pumps/sewage-drainage-pumps',NULL,NULL,0,1);
